            "sid": "JDG 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninye ninche, “Entusujuaki; amu eishorua Olaitoriani ilmang'ati linyi lelo Moabu apik atua enkaina inyi.” Neaku etadoitie apa ninche aasujaa ninye, neibung ilang'at olkeju le Yordan naaimu Ilmoabu, neitu ninche eisho hoo oltung'ani obo metalang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Near ninche ina olong iltung'ana oobaya nkalifuni tomon loo Lmoabu, oogol pooki, eitu ninye eimisho obo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku etimiraki apa Moab ina olong nejing abori enkaina e Israel. Netum apa ina kop enkiyeng'iyeng too larin ntomoni isiet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
